Subject: [PATCH] cli: isolate candidate admission from passive API access

Retain the native controller single-command limit without holding native tree
ownership throughout protocol waiting. Report rejected native submissions
immediately instead of waiting for a response to a command never accepted.
Publish the native limit, capability negotiation and queue/service timings.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [lab profiling adapter]

